# Code owners (Round 30, G-11). Read by GitHub only when the `main` ruleset
# requires code-owner review (.github/rulesets/main-review.json, to be enabled
# once a second maintainer exists; with one maintainer a required review is a
# deadlock, since an author cannot approve their own pull request).
